  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Primary action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Official shadcn Button with authored taupe action styling and quiet movement.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary\" data-slot=\"button\" data-variant=\"default\" data-size=\"default\">Get Cozy Gray<svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{font-family:var(--font-family, 'Geist Variable', sans-serif);font-size:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:25px;min-height:49px;padding:14px 23px;border:0;border-radius:5px;font-weight:550;background:var(--action,#d0cbc5);color:var(--action-ink,#39342f);cursor:pointer;transition:background .25s,transform .25s}.ds-primary:hover{background:#c2bab2;transform:translateY(-2px)}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#333231);outline-offset:5px;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in oklab,var(--ring,#333231) 50%,transparent);}.ds-primary:active{transform:translateY(1px)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-primary{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-text",
      "description": "Unfilled navigation or disclosure-related action.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-text\">Installation guide<svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-text{font-family:var(--font-family, 'Geist Variable', sans-serif);font-size:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;border:0;padding:5px 0;background:none;color:var(--ink,#333231);cursor:pointer}.ds-text svg{transition:transform .2s}.ds-text:hover svg{transform:translate(3px,-3px)}.ds-text:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#333231);outline-offset:5px;}.ds-text:active{transform:translateY(1px)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-text svg{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Theme appearance",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "mode-switch",
      "description": "Official shadcn single ToggleGroup, reused for appearance, view, language, and filters; selected items use data-state=\"on\".",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-mode\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Theme appearance\"><button aria-pressed=\"false\" data-state=\"off\">Light</button><button aria-pressed=\"true\" data-state=\"on\">Dark</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-mode{display:inline-flex;gap:3px;padding:4px;background:var(--surface,#e2e0dd);border-radius:6px}.ds-mode button{font-family:var(--font-family, 'Geist Variable', sans-serif);font-size:14px;font-size:13px;padding:8px 13px;min-height:33px;background:transparent;color:var(--text-secondary,#605d59);border:0;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s,color .2s}.ds-mode button[data-state=on]{background:var(--ink,#333231);color:var(--bg,#eeedeb)}.ds-mode button:hover:not([data-state=on]){background:var(--stage,#dad8d5)}.ds-mode button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#333231);outline-offset:5px;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in oklab,var(--ring,#333231) 50%,transparent);}.ds-mode button:active{transform:translateY(1px)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-mode button{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Platform search",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "search-field",
      "description": "Flat field with full-width mobile behavior.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-search\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"m15 15 5 5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/></svg><input type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Find your tool\" aria-label=\"Search platforms\"/></label>",
      "css": ".ds-search{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--bg,#eeedeb);color:var(--text-secondary,#605d59);border-radius:4px;width:220px}.ds-search input{font-family:var(--font-family, 'Geist Variable', sans-serif);font-size:14px;font-size:13px;min-width:0;width:100%;border:0;background:none;color:var(--ink,#333231)}.ds-search input::placeholder{color:var(--text-secondary,#605d59);opacity:1}.ds-search input{outline:0}.ds-search:focus-within{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#333231);outline-offset:4px}.ds-search:hover{color:var(--ink,#333231)}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-search{width:auto;min-height:44px}.ds-search input{font-size:14px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Platform selection",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "platform-select",
      "description": "Custom shadcn/Radix Select with grouped, scrollable options and keyboard navigation. Static specimen below shows its closed trigger.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-select\" type=\"button\" role=\"combobox\" aria-label=\"Choose your tool\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>VS Code</span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-select{font-family:var(--font-family, 'Geist Variable', sans-serif);font-size:14px;width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;min-height:52px;padding:16px 17px;border:0;border-radius:5px;background:var(--surface,#e2e0dd);color:var(--ink,#333231);cursor:pointer}.ds-select:hover{color:var(--ink,#333231)}.ds-select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#333231);outline-offset:5px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Section navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation",
      "description": "Simple section anchors with opacity hover.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"#preview\">Preview</a><a href=\"#palette\">Palette</a><a href=\"#platforms\">Platforms</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;gap:36px;align-items:center;height:110px}.ds-nav a{font-family:var(--font-family, 'Geist Variable', sans-serif);font-size:14px;color:var(--ink,#333231);text-decoration:none;transition:opacity .2s}.ds-nav a:hover{opacity:.6}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#333231);outline-offset:5px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav a{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Install surface",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "install-panel",
      "description": "Tonal panel with readable steps and source disclosure.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><div>VS Code <span>Native theme file</span></div><ol><li>Download the JSON theme file below.</li><li>Follow the tool-specific installation steps.</li></ol><details><summary>View theme file</summary><pre>{ \"name\": \"Cozy Gray Dark\" }</pre></details></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{font-family:var(--font-family, 'Geist Variable', sans-serif);font-size:14px;padding:30px;background:var(--surface,#e2e0dd);color:var(--ink,#333231);border-radius:6px;max-width:480px}.ds-panel>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}.ds-panel span{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-secondary,#605d59)}.ds-panel ol{display:grid;gap:22px;padding-left:24px;margin:28px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7}.ds-panel summary{font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;padding:8px 0;color:var(--text-secondary,#605d59)}.ds-panel summary:hover{color:var(--ink,#333231)}.ds-panel summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#333231);outline-offset:5px;}.ds-panel pre{padding:15px;background:var(--bg,#eeedeb);font-family:\"Geist Mono Variable\",monospace;font-size:13px;overflow:auto}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Palette copy swatch",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "swatch",
      "description": "Flat labeled theme role with lift and copy affordance.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-swatch\"><span class=\"ds-color\"><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-name\">Amber</span><span class=\"ds-value\">#e6c078</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-swatch{font-family:var(--font-family, 'Geist Variable', sans-serif);font-size:14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:start;width:150px;padding:0;border:0;background:none;color:var(--ink,#333231);text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.ds-color{display:flex;justify-content:end;width:100%;height:120px;padding:13px;background:var(--code-string,#e6c078);color:#3b3530;border-radius:4px;transition:transform .3s}.ds-color svg{opacity:0;mix-blend-mode:difference;transition:opacity .25s}.ds-swatch:hover .ds-color{transform:translateY(-6px)}.ds-swatch:hover svg,.ds-swatch:focus-visible svg{opacity:1}.ds-swatch:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#333231);outline-offset:5px;}.ds-swatch:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-name{font-size:13px;margin-top:16px}.ds-value{font-size:13px;margin-top:5px;color:var(--text-secondary,#605d59);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-color,.ds-color svg{transition:none}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Warm Gray Workspace",
    "overview": "Cozy Gray uses warm off-gray fields, graphite text, quiet taupe actions, and readable code to make a developer workspace feel quiet and familiar. Broad spacing and soft, compact controls carry the presentation; the theme itself supplies the color. The name above describes the implemented world and is not a user-approved creative concept.\n\nThis records the current code-first implementation: Astro serves `src/pages/index.astro`, React hydrates `src/App.tsx` with `client:load`, and official shadcn/ui Button, ToggleGroup, and Select components use Tailwind CSS v4 semantic integration. The user confirmed this stack and code-first workflow, then requested less green and brighter syntax. Geist was selected through the explicitly invoked gpt-taste workflow. The earlier sage-led palette and unanswered-stack status are superseded. There is no approved visual comp; this record does not imply a concept-selection workflow. The revision is verified in the browser at desktop (1440px), mobile (390px), and intermediate (890px) widths without document overflow. Current captures in `.impeccable/review/` cover both theme appearances and the dark website appearance. Browser checks confirm hydrated controls, Python switching, Editor/Terminal view, filters/search and empty-state recovery, platform selection, Ghostty download, palette copy, tmux source disclosure/copy, FAQ, mobile navigation, website mode, and saved Light restoration after reload. Astro build and source assertions for palette contrast/parity and static server-rendered output pass; browser checks show no post-fix warnings or errors. These checks do not establish native target-application validation. The revision detector reports the pre-existing Geist warning and type-ramp advisory; Geist remains the explicitly selected font.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Neutral warm gray surfaces with brighter amber, coral, sand, and rose syntax roles.",
      "Independent website and downloaded-theme appearances.",
      "Wide editorial headings with compact native workspace fragments.",
      "One generated material photograph, paired with live illustrative code.",
      "Flat tonal depth, quiet motion, and a static reduced-motion composition."
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "dos": [
      "Do keep the shared theme mode consistent across preview, palette, and download.",
      "Do retain visible Planned labels and the app-validation limitation beside platform choices.",
      "Do preserve the illustrative-code disclosure and the generated photograph\u2019s provenance.",
      "Do keep reading and installation copy at the body scale; allow horizontal scrolling for code.",
      "Do preserve focus outlines, semantic control states, and the reduced-motion static layout."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't treat website appearance as the downloaded palette selection.",
      "Don't present authored files as validated native integrations or marketplace releases.",
      "Don't make medical or display-emission claims from the gray palette.",
      "Don't extend compact editor-chrome text sizes to reading copy.",
      "Don't reintroduce a green cast to the page surfaces or use sage as the action/syntax palette.",
      "Don't replace the warm neutral foundation with blue-dominant backgrounds or vivid blue syntax."
    ]
  }
